## Abstract

We give a slight improvement of the best known lower bound for the supremum of autoconvolutions of nonnegative functions supported in a compact interval. Also, by means of explicit examples we disprove a long standing natural conjecture of Schinzel and Schmidt concerning the extremal function for such autoconvolutions. Comment: 15 pages. Some typos have been corrected, the best examples have been slightly improved, two plots of them have been included and some remarks have been added

